<listitem>
<para>Boxing Day, December 26th </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s Eve, December 31st </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Holidays for the Frankfurt <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_stock" kindref="compound">Stock</ref> exchange (data from <ulink url="http://deutsche-boerse.com/">http://deutsche-boerse.com/</ulink>): <itemizedlist>
